# Oscorp Industries: a land played by mayhem is the land play of the turn (CR 305.2), and so one made already refuses it: with an
# Island played from the hand, Oscorp, discarded this turn, can't be played from the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Island x5
Oscorp Industries
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
